    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "header",
            "block_content": "Part 14 Other provisions applying to superannuation entities ",
            "block_bbox": [
                151,
                1,
                716,
                31
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": null
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 114",
            "block_bbox": [
                152,
                92,
                292,
                115
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Part 14- Other provisions applying to superannuation entities ",
            "block_bbox": [
                155,
                184,
                763,
                261
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "114 Object of Part ",
            "block_bbox": [
                156,
                313,
                389,
                338
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The object of this Part is to set out various rules applying to superannuation entities.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                287,
                356,
                908,
                413
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "115 Trustee of superannuation entity may maintain reserves ",
            "block_bbox": [
                153,
                444,
                893,
                473
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) The trustee of a superannuation entity may maintain a reserve of the entity for a particular purpose, unless the governing rules of the entity prohibit the maintenance of a reserve for that purpose.",
            "block_bbox": [
                243,
                494,
                998,
                577
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Governing rules of an RSE must not prohibit reserves to cover operational risk \n",
            "block_bbox": [
                284,
                606,
                953,
                667
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) The governing rules of a registrable superannuation entity must not prohibit the maintenance of a reserve to cover the operational risk relating to the entity.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                243,
                685,
                1008,
                774
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) If the governing rules of a registrable superannuation entity are inconsistent with subsection (2):",
            "block_bbox": [
                243,
                791,
                972,
                850
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) subsection (2) prevails, and ",
            "block_bbox": [
                309,
                858,
                658,
                885
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A \ninconsistency.\n\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                307,
                887,
                905,
                944
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 11
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "116 Agreement between trustee and investment manager ",
            "block_bbox": [
                156,
                980,
                881,
                1010
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 12
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Despite anything in the governing rules of a superannuation entity,any provision of an agreement between a trustee of the entity and an investment manager that purports to exempt the investment manager from liability for negligence, or to limit that liability, is void.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                293,
                1025,
                1023,
                1172
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 13
        },
        {
            "block_label": "number",
            "block_content": "352",
            "block_bbox": [
                164,
                1306,
                195,
                1323
            ],
            "block_id": 14,
            "block_order": null
        },
        {
            "block_label": "footer",
            "block_content": "Superannuation Industry (Supervision) Act 1993",
            "block_bbox": [
                441,
